/** @page treesitter_languagesguide Supported Grammars

    @tableofcontents

    Pass one of the following language names to
    @ref TreeSitter::TreeSitterParser::constructor(string) "TreeSitterParser::constructor()":

    |!Grammar|!Language name|!Alias
    |Python|\c python|None
    |Java|\c java|None
    |JSON|\c json|None
    |YAML|\c yaml|None
    |JavaScript|\c javascript|\c js
    |Kotlin|\c kotlin|\c kt
    |TypeScript|\c typescript|\c ts
    |TSX (TypeScript with JSX)|\c tsx|None
    |SQL|\c sql|None
    |Markdown|\c markdown|\c md
    |Qore|\c qore|None

    @ref TreeSitter::TreeSitterParser::getSupportedLanguages() "TreeSitterParser::getSupportedLanguages()"
    returns the language names in the table, without aliases.

    @note The Qore tree-sitter grammar is provided by the \c astparser module built into Qore 3.0 and later.
    The \c treesitter module reuses the grammar from \c modules/astparser/grammars/tree-sitter-qore/ in the
    <a href="https://github.com/qoretechnologies/qore">Qore repository</a>.
*/
